SOLUTION 0-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 11
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001

TRANSPORT
    cells 10
    shifts 10
    length 10
    time_step 1
    flow_direction forward
    boundary_conditions flux flux
    punch_cells 1-10
    print_cells 1-10
    print_frequency 1
    punch_frequency 1
    initial_time 0
    dump "dump.out" end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file transport_selout.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -molalities NaX
